{"sha": "b405c2a1006f69aab166fb1a86c30dd1352b9434137fe38ab207afebba8add2f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:oscillators-resonance} 章 --- 机械振子：阻尼与共振}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:1}", "$\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{80/0.20} = \\qty{20}{rad/s}$，$f_0 = \\qty{3.2}{Hz}$，$T_0 =", "\\qty{0.31}{s}$；$v_{\\max} = A\\omega_0 = \\qty{1.0}{m/s}$；$E = \\tfrac12 kA^2 =", "\\qty{0.10}{J}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:2}", "$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\ell/g}$：地球上为 \\qty{2.0}{s}，月球上为 \\qty{4.9}{s}。", "质量--弹簧的周期 $2\\pi\\sqrt{m/k}$ 不含 $g$：", "不变。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:3}", "$\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0 = 100/(4\\pi) = \\qty{8.0}{s}$；能量 $\\propto \\eu^{-2t/\\tau}$", "在 $t = \\tau\\ln2/2 = \\qty{2.8}{s}$ 时减半；能量降至 $5\\%$ 约需 $3\\tau = \\qty{24}{s}$，", "约为 $48 \\approx Q$ 次振动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:4}", "$X_0 = F_0/k = \\qty{1.0}{cm}$；共振时 $\\approx QX_0 = \\qty{10}{cm}$；", "在 $3\\omega_0$ 处：$X_0/\\sqrt{64 + 0.09} = \\qty{0.13}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:5}", "$v = Lf_0 = 8.0 \\times 1.3 = \\qty{10}{m/s}$（\\qty{37}{km/h}）。在", "\\qty{60}{km/h}时：$f = 16.7/8.0 = \\qty{2.1}{Hz}$，$x_r = 1.6$：$X/X_g =", "\\sqrt{(1 + 5.2)/(2.4 + 5.2)} = 0.90$ --- 隔振效果很差；隔振", "需要 $x_r \\gg 1$（在 \\qty{120}{km/h} 时，$x_r = 3.2$：$0.45$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:6}", "推力做功为正，仅当推力沿运动方向作用时；", "若每个周期都施力，则所有推力的作用相加；在其他节奏下，它们", "交替正负。稳态时：$2\\pi E/Q = \\qty{25}{J}$，$E = \\qty{80}{J}$；", "$mg\\ell(1 - \\cos\\theta_{\\max}) = 80$：$1 - \\cos\\theta_{\\max} = 0.109$，", "$\\theta_{\\max} = 27^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:7}", "$\\delta = \\ln(1/0.9) = 0.105$，$Q = \\pi/\\delta = 30$；$\\Delta f = f_0/Q =", "\\qty{0.067}{Hz}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:8}", "位移：远低于共振频率时同相（$\\varphi = 0$），共振时为 $-\\pi/2$，", "远高于共振频率时为 $-\\pi$（反相）。共振时速度与驱动力", "同相。功率为 $\\vect F\\cdot\\vect v$：", "决定驱动力做功多少的，是速度的相位，", "而非位移的相位。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:9}", "$V = \\omega X = \\omega(F_0/m)/\\sqrt{(\\omega_0^2 - \\omega^2)^2 + (\\omega\\omega_0/Q)^2}$；", "分子分母同除以 $\\omega\\omega_0/Q$：$V = (F_0Q/m\\omega_0)/", "\\sqrt{1 + Q^2(\\omega_0/\\omega - \\omega/\\omega_0)^2}$，且 $F_0Q/m\\omega_0 = F_0/\\alpha$。", "平方根 $\\geq 1$，等于 $1$ 恰在 $\\omega = \\omega_0$ 处成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:10}", "$P = F_0^2/2\\alpha = \\qty{10}{W}$；$V_{\\max} = F_0/\\alpha = \\qty{20}{m/s}$，", "$E = \\tfrac12 mV_{\\max}^2 = \\qty{40}{J}$；$E/P = \\qty{4.0}{s}$ 且 $Q/\\omega_0 =", "m/\\alpha = \\qty{4.0}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:11}", "$3\\tau = \\qty{10}{s}$：$\\tau = \\qty{3.3}{s}$，$Q = \\omega_0\\tau/2 = 2\\pi \\times", "440 \\times 3.3/2 \\approx 4600$；$\\Delta f = f_0/Q = \\qty{0.1}{Hz}$。它", "几乎只响应并发出一个频率：这是一种精度达", "到 $10^4$ 分之几的标准。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:oscillators-resonance:12}", "$m\\ddot x = mg - \\rho_wgS(h + x) = -\\rho_wgSx$（因为 $mg = \\rho_wgSh$）：", "$\\omega_0^2 = \\rho_wgS/m = g/h$；$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{0.10/9.81} = \\qty{0.63}{s}$。", "质量与液体密度都只通过", "平衡深度 $h$ 发挥作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:oscillators-resonance:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 受力：重力（与静态伸长所产生的弹力平衡）、弹簧力", "$-ku$、阻尼器力 $-\\alpha\\dot u$；$m\\ddot x = -ku - \\alpha\\dot u$，其中 $\\ddot x =", "\\ddot x_g + \\ddot u$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\ddot u + (\\omega_0/Q)\\dot u + \\omega_0^2u = -\\ddot x_g$，$\\omega_0 =", "\\sqrt{k/m}$，$Q = \\sqrt{km}/\\alpha$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $k = m\\omega_0^2 = \\pi^2 = \\qty{9.9}{N/m}$；$\\alpha = m\\omega_0/Q =", "3.14/0.70 = \\qty{4.5}{N.s/m}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $u = -a_g/\\omega_0^2$：质量块下沉一个固定量 --- 该", "仪器在零频率下即为加速度计（同时也是倾斜仪）。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 相对位移 $u(t)$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $-\\omega^2\\underline U + j\\omega(\\omega_0/Q)\\underline U + \\omega_0^2\\underline U", "= \\omega^2X_g$；两边除以 $\\omega_0^2$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $U/X_g = x_r^2/\\sqrt{(1 - x_r^2)^2 + x_r^2/Q^2}$.", "", "\\textbf{8.} $U \\to X_g$：质量块在惯性参考系中不动", "（其惯性使它保持静止，而弹簧太软，无法拖动它）；", "参考系绕它运动，笔记录的是地面位移", "--- 即地震仪。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $U \\approx x_r^2X_g = \\omega^2X_g/\\omega_0^2 = a_g/\\omega_0^2$：", "加速度计。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $U = QX_g = 0.7X_g$：没有峰值；两种状态平滑衔接，", "仪器不会振铃。", ""]}